-- title:
--   Local analytic parametrizations and contact order
-- statement:
--   Local additive homomorphisms on a positive-radius parameter ball, actual convergent power-series coordinate lifts, their generated subgroup, derivative-defined contact order, and tangent codimensions. Representative independence, identity-principle arguments, and the comparison of local image, generated subgroup and source analytic subgroup require separate proofs.
